Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): stage canonical containment transport and
 replica markers [daveey]

Bind durable single-request delivery to canonical Board event bytes and admitted worker claims/sessions. Add server-owned episode markers and durable local observations to hold task-before-history page gaps, including a new episode after a valid old release. Upgrade opt-in storage triggers atomically. Keep public entry points and production containment capability disabled pending complete integration.

Proof: canonical combined containment files185 passed; subsequent scope/envelope/replica capture consumers88 passed; marker/actor/schema consumers79 passed. These overlap and are not a distinct grand total. Six selected paging guard mutants killed against a green5-case baseline. Full scripts/check21checks green. Board companion full suite1181 passed1skipped and typecheck green. No PR, deployment or live relay lifecycle application.
